## Template Application

When the create-template command is received, I will:
1. Execute the research process to gather all necessary context
2. Pay special attention to the conversation summaries for chat IDs referenced in the standard parameters
3. Thoroughly analyze all available information in the `<previous_conversations_summaries>` tag
4. Document which conversation summaries were analyzed and what information they contained
5. Verify actual file states against claims made in the conversation summaries
6. Create or update requirements.md with this template
7. Document all research findings in the Research Documentation section
8. Include a comprehensive Chat Analysis section detailing what was learned from each conversation summary
9. Identify and document any discrepancies between claimed and actual implementation
10. Leave other sections empty for Tyler to fill in
11. Wait for Tyler to complete the requirements before proceeding with any planning

